## Python3 코드

코드1
```python
product = 1

def f(n):
    for i in range(1, n + 1):
        product *= i

f(5)

print(product)

```

코드2
```python
arr = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]

def f(n):
    product = 1
    for i in range(n):
        product *= arr[i]
    return product

print(f(5))

```

## C 코드

코드1
```c
int f(int n) {  
    for(int i = 1; i <= n; i++)
        product *= i;
}

int main() {
    int product = 1;
    f(5);
    printf("%d", product);
}
```

코드2
```c
int arr[] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
int f(int n) {  
    int product = 1;
    for(int i = 0; i < n; i++)
        product *= arr[i];
    return product;
}

int main() {
    printf("%d", f(5));
}
```

